WEBVTT

00:00:19.322 --> 00:00:21.925
That song again?

00:00:21.925 --> 00:00:23.360
You sure like it.

00:00:23.360 --> 00:00:26.463
What's wrong with that? It might
be old, but it's a wonderful song.

00:00:26.463 --> 00:00:29.599
Besides, Rita likes it, too.

00:00:29.599 --> 00:00:32.432
She falls asleep easily with this song.

00:00:45.281 --> 00:00:47.484
Solty.

00:00:47.484 --> 00:00:48.585
That melody...

00:00:48.585 --> 00:00:51.488
Oh, I learned it from Miss Rose.

00:00:51.488 --> 00:00:54.791
She said humming it relaxes you, so...

00:00:54.791 --> 00:00:57.225
Rose was humming it?

00:00:58.228 --> 00:01:01.231
I've got Miss Rose.

00:01:01.231 --> 00:01:06.066
Come alone to the Crown Center Building
on South 3rd Street.

00:01:14.344 --> 00:01:22.085
Nee ima made shiritakatta
otogi-banashi no tsuzuki

00:01:22.085 --> 00:01:28.615
Eien ni owaranai shiawase
nara kono te de

00:01:30.260 --> 00:01:40.236
Bokura wa marude ichimai-chigai
no guuzen o sagashiatte

00:01:40.236 --> 00:01:42.405
Meguriatta

00:01:42.405 --> 00:01:50.580
Kimi ga itsuka nomikonda
sono kotoba yori

00:01:50.580 --> 00:01:59.489
Zutto iezu ni itekureteta yasashisa o

00:01:59.489 --> 00:02:06.396
Shinjitai to ima omounda

00:02:06.396 --> 00:02:14.137
Nee kono saki wa doko made
mo fuan to tonari-awase

00:02:14.137 --> 00:02:20.543
Nakusu mono ga nakatta
bokutachi wa mou inai

00:02:20.543 --> 00:02:28.251
Nee ima made shiranakatta
otogi-banashi no tsuzuki

00:02:28.251 --> 00:02:34.557
Eien ni owaranai shiawase
nara kono te de

00:02:34.557 --> 00:02:38.516
Tsumikasanete yuku mono

00:02:44.300 --> 00:02:44.634
"Beyond the Conclusion -Tears-"

00:02:44.634 --> 00:02:47.670
"Beyond the Conclusion -Tears-"
Mother, Father...

00:02:47.670 --> 00:02:48.972
"Beyond the Conclusion -Tears-"
It's so far for you. You came
all this way just for me?

00:02:48.972 --> 00:02:50.371
It's so far for you. You came
all this way just for me?

00:02:50.371 --> 00:02:54.208
Of course, we did.
You're our precious only daughter.

00:02:54.208 --> 00:02:56.877
Here, we brought you a get-well gift.

00:02:56.877 --> 00:02:59.580
You used to love these, remember?

00:02:59.580 --> 00:03:01.241
A melon!

00:03:02.583 --> 00:03:04.918
So Celica's parents are here.

00:03:04.918 --> 00:03:06.253
Yeah.

00:03:06.253 --> 00:03:08.022
So, how's the case going?

00:03:08.022 --> 00:03:09.823
You know who the perpetrator is, right?

00:03:09.823 --> 00:03:12.860
Yes, a formal arrest warrant
has been issued.

00:03:12.860 --> 00:03:14.728
All that's left is to apprehend him.

00:03:14.728 --> 00:03:15.929
I see.

00:03:15.929 --> 00:03:17.765
You and Celica are off duty, you know.

00:03:17.765 --> 00:03:21.132
I know. I don't want to get in the way.

00:03:22.136 --> 00:03:24.905
Leave things to us this time around.

00:03:24.905 --> 00:03:26.440
Right, Accela?

00:03:26.440 --> 00:03:28.475
Yes.

00:03:28.475 --> 00:03:30.204
We'll be counting on you.

00:03:32.413 --> 00:03:34.715
You look better than I expected.

00:03:34.715 --> 00:03:37.418
What part of this is "better"?

00:03:37.418 --> 00:03:39.153
If I'd noticed it a second later,

00:03:39.153 --> 00:03:42.189
everything above my neck
would've been gone.

00:03:42.189 --> 00:03:44.258
Smuggling you out of the hospital up there

00:03:44.258 --> 00:03:46.660
took quite a bit of doing, you know.

00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:50.064
Don't worry. There will be
payback for this, I promise.

00:03:50.064 --> 00:03:51.965
Be careful, Bro.

00:03:51.965 --> 00:03:52.866
I will.

00:03:52.866 --> 00:03:55.903
And also, that...

00:03:55.903 --> 00:03:56.770
This?

00:03:56.770 --> 00:03:59.406
Yeah, that investigation report.

00:03:59.406 --> 00:04:01.675
There were some among
the competenters, too.

00:04:01.675 --> 00:04:05.979
Girls whose genetic makeup
had mutated after Blast Fall...

00:04:05.979 --> 00:04:07.147
I see.

00:04:07.147 --> 00:04:09.183
You're not surprised?

00:04:09.183 --> 00:04:11.583
You knew about it, didn't you?

00:04:13.120 --> 00:04:14.888
It was written in there.

00:04:14.888 --> 00:04:18.592
With some of the girls,
it even changed the color of their hair.

00:04:18.592 --> 00:04:21.562
You've sort of suspected this,
haven't you, Bro?

00:04:21.562 --> 00:04:23.621
That Rose could be...

00:04:28.802 --> 00:04:30.137
Roy...

00:04:30.137 --> 00:04:35.109
The location Hou specified is in
a ghost town where no one lives now.

00:04:35.109 --> 00:04:36.643
I see.

00:04:36.643 --> 00:04:40.047
There will undoubtedly be
many traps laid for you.

00:04:40.047 --> 00:04:41.615
Yeah.

00:04:41.615 --> 00:04:43.083
Mr. Roy, please allow me to also...

00:04:43.083 --> 00:04:44.880
Don't follow me.

00:04:47.221 --> 00:04:49.389
I'm going alone.

00:04:49.389 --> 00:04:50.858
Roy...

00:04:50.858 --> 00:04:53.793
I'm going to settle this.

00:04:55.963 --> 00:04:59.066
Make sure you save Rose, okay?

00:04:59.066 --> 00:05:00.667
I know.

00:05:00.667 --> 00:05:02.100
Mr. Roy...

00:05:17.117 --> 00:05:19.720
It's you...

00:05:19.720 --> 00:05:24.458
There's one thing I have to tell you.

00:05:24.458 --> 00:05:26.727
Rose...

00:05:26.727 --> 00:05:28.854
...might be your daughter.

00:05:30.197 --> 00:05:32.733
I see.

00:05:32.733 --> 00:05:34.735
You knew?

00:05:34.735 --> 00:05:38.364
Just recently, by total coincidence...

00:05:39.573 --> 00:05:42.474
Rose is not related to us by blood.

00:05:43.577 --> 00:05:45.306
I still remember even now...

00:05:46.480 --> 00:05:48.482
Right after Blast Fall,

00:05:48.482 --> 00:05:51.576
my old man brought her home.
She was still very young.

00:05:56.456 --> 00:06:00.227
She had lost her memory
and she couldn't even speak.

00:06:00.227 --> 00:06:03.330
So my old man decided to
take her in as his daughter

00:06:03.330 --> 00:06:04.922
and named her Rose.

00:06:06.833 --> 00:06:10.428
These are the things
Rose had on her at the time.

00:06:11.572 --> 00:06:13.674
Do they look familiar?

00:06:13.674 --> 00:06:14.902
Yeah.

00:06:16.243 --> 00:06:19.179
They belonged to my daughter...

00:06:19.179 --> 00:06:21.348
...most likely.

00:06:21.348 --> 00:06:23.584
This isn't publicly known,

00:06:23.584 --> 00:06:27.588
but there are girls whose
genes mutated after Blast Fall.

00:06:27.588 --> 00:06:29.556
The cause is unknown,

00:06:29.556 --> 00:06:34.261
but it's possible Rose is one of them.

00:06:34.261 --> 00:06:36.129
There's no scientific basis for this,

00:06:36.129 --> 00:06:39.155
but the circumstantial evidence
all supports it.

00:06:53.714 --> 00:06:57.445
Miss Rose is Mr. Roy's daughter?

00:07:07.027 --> 00:07:09.396
Wh-What are you laughing
to yourself about?!

00:07:09.396 --> 00:07:10.886
It's creepy.

00:07:12.733 --> 00:07:14.701
You've experienced it, too, haven't you?

00:07:14.701 --> 00:07:16.903
Where you can't wait for
the show that's about to start

00:07:16.903 --> 00:07:19.539
and you can't keep
your laughter contained.

00:07:19.539 --> 00:07:21.775
Oh, I don't know that I have.

00:07:21.775 --> 00:07:24.978
More importantly,
you're after that old guy, right?

00:07:24.978 --> 00:07:26.780
I've got nothing to do with this.

00:07:26.780 --> 00:07:27.781
Let me go!

00:07:27.781 --> 00:07:29.816
Now that's something I can't do.

00:07:29.816 --> 00:07:31.952
After all, you're my precious bait.

00:07:31.952 --> 00:07:34.855
So, why me?!

00:07:34.855 --> 00:07:36.490
It just ended up that way.

00:07:36.490 --> 00:07:38.825
Because you lived with Roy.

00:07:38.825 --> 00:07:41.623
I took care of the other one with a bomb.

00:07:42.996 --> 00:07:46.199
Though, it seems I failed.

00:07:46.199 --> 00:07:47.601
I'm not surprised.

00:07:47.601 --> 00:07:51.071
Don't worry. That man will
come to save you for sure.

00:07:51.071 --> 00:07:53.540
It might've been a
different story back then,

00:07:53.540 --> 00:07:57.544
but he seems to have
mellowed out quite a bit lately.

00:07:57.544 --> 00:07:58.879
Back then?

00:07:58.879 --> 00:08:01.481
So, you don't know.

00:08:01.481 --> 00:08:03.383
It was something dreadful.

00:08:03.383 --> 00:08:07.752
He was so crazy, he was truly
worthy of being called a mad dog.

00:08:08.655 --> 00:08:11.391
I think that was roughly 10 years ago.

00:08:11.391 --> 00:08:14.261
He was still a police officer back then.

00:08:14.261 --> 00:08:16.630
It made you wonder just
what he had against them,

00:08:16.630 --> 00:08:19.499
the way he mercilessly beat criminals.

00:08:19.499 --> 00:08:22.798
A countless number of them even
got battered beyond hope of recovery.

00:08:24.438 --> 00:08:27.708
I was also one of those victims, you see.

00:08:27.708 --> 00:08:30.744
I took 12 bullets to my right arm here.

00:08:30.744 --> 00:08:36.650
My tendons and veins and bones
were all torn to shreds.

00:08:36.650 --> 00:08:39.820
Why do you suppose he did that?

00:08:39.820 --> 00:08:42.122
Here's what he said...

00:08:42.122 --> 00:08:44.358
"My daughter disappeared in Blast Fall,

00:08:44.358 --> 00:08:47.828
so why are scum like you still alive?"

00:08:47.828 --> 00:08:50.430
Makes you laugh, doesn't it?

00:08:50.430 --> 00:08:53.233
The reason he destroyed my right arm,

00:08:53.233 --> 00:08:55.402
which creates such artistic bombs,

00:08:55.402 --> 00:08:59.473
was his need to vent his rage at
not being able to find his daughter.

00:08:59.473 --> 00:09:02.576
You know she's got to be dead already.

00:09:02.576 --> 00:09:04.811
It's beyond unfair.

00:09:04.811 --> 00:09:08.615
That's why you're going
to kill that old man?

00:09:08.615 --> 00:09:13.854
With bullets, one to the chest
or stomach and you can die, right?

00:09:13.854 --> 00:09:19.326
But he fired 12 shots
just into my right arm.

00:09:19.326 --> 00:09:22.929
The terror and pain I felt with each shot...

00:09:22.929 --> 00:09:28.128
I won't be happy until I've put him
through the same experience.

00:09:29.136 --> 00:09:33.006
Whoops. Looks like he arrived
while we were chitchatting.

00:09:33.006 --> 00:09:34.735
The man we've been waiting for.

00:09:45.585 --> 00:09:47.154
Solty.

00:09:47.154 --> 00:09:51.825
I heard that Miss Rose
is your daughter and...

00:09:51.825 --> 00:09:53.226
I would like to help, after all...

00:09:53.226 --> 00:09:55.195
Go home.

00:09:55.195 --> 00:09:56.863
You go home.

00:09:56.863 --> 00:09:58.660
This is my job.

00:10:07.340 --> 00:10:09.910
Accela, I'm going out.

00:10:09.910 --> 00:10:11.611
I'll need your support.

00:10:11.611 --> 00:10:12.600
All right.

00:10:23.123 --> 00:10:26.059
She's a guest I hadn't planned for,
but that's all right.

00:10:26.059 --> 00:10:28.653
A certain degree of freedom
is necessary in games.

00:10:29.563 --> 00:10:32.999
Now begins the third stage!

00:10:50.517 --> 00:10:52.451
It's the same as before.

00:11:11.838 --> 00:11:13.032
What the?

00:11:14.107 --> 00:11:15.438
Damn it!

00:11:35.228 --> 00:11:37.458
I guess he's changed some things.

00:11:39.399 --> 00:11:40.667
Splendid.

00:11:40.667 --> 00:11:44.871
The bombs I create are splendid, indeed!

00:11:44.871 --> 00:11:47.207
They're truly works of art!

00:11:47.207 --> 00:11:49.698
It looks like Roy is enjoying them as well.

00:11:56.182 --> 00:12:01.017
Now, I'll prepare the next stage
so he has more to enjoy.

00:12:06.059 --> 00:12:09.195
The overclock usage limit is 3 times.

00:12:09.195 --> 00:12:11.464
I will count it down while you are active.

00:12:11.464 --> 00:12:12.795
Roger that.

00:12:16.870 --> 00:12:19.773
M-Mr. Roy!

00:12:19.773 --> 00:12:22.809
Wh-Where are you?!

00:12:22.809 --> 00:12:24.504
Mr. Roy...

00:13:01.114 --> 00:13:02.706
You idiot! Stay back!

00:13:04.584 --> 00:13:08.755
That's right. Acting hastily
is a no-no, my friend.

00:13:08.755 --> 00:13:10.290
Hou...

00:13:10.290 --> 00:13:14.027
The panels tiled around the little missy

00:13:14.027 --> 00:13:16.463
are all pressure-sensitive bombs.

00:13:16.463 --> 00:13:18.398
However, unlike mines,

00:13:18.398 --> 00:13:21.835
the panel that explodes
won't be the panel you step on.

00:13:21.835 --> 00:13:23.029
Watch!

00:13:26.740 --> 00:13:28.375
Like so.

00:13:28.375 --> 00:13:30.010
Naturally, in some areas,

00:13:30.010 --> 00:13:33.313
the spot you step on
might explode just like a mine.

00:13:33.313 --> 00:13:36.816
Also, the chair the
little missy's sitting on...

00:13:36.816 --> 00:13:39.452
This is also a pressure-sensitive bomb.

00:13:39.452 --> 00:13:43.490
The moment the little missy
gets off the chair... boom!

00:13:43.490 --> 00:13:46.593
I've made sure to attach
a timer, too, so be careful.

00:13:46.593 --> 00:13:50.620
O-Oh, no... I have to hurry up,
so I can go help...

00:14:00.807 --> 00:14:05.111
Oh, and also, you see the stairs
behind the little missy?

00:14:05.111 --> 00:14:07.914
I'm on the floor up those stairs.

00:14:07.914 --> 00:14:10.316
You can save the little missy,

00:14:10.316 --> 00:14:13.217
but you can also abandon her
and come fight me.

00:14:14.654 --> 00:14:17.323
Hey, you better save me first!

00:14:17.323 --> 00:14:21.928
Oh, but you could take him out first
and then come save me...

00:14:21.928 --> 00:14:25.165
No! If he takes you out instead...

00:14:25.165 --> 00:14:27.901
Oh, darn it! What are we to do?!

00:14:27.901 --> 00:14:30.570
Now, what'll you do, my friend?

00:14:30.570 --> 00:14:32.800
That's obvious.

00:14:36.643 --> 00:14:37.977
I've found him!

00:14:37.977 --> 00:14:40.070
Hou is not in the specified building.

00:14:42.348 --> 00:14:44.017
Hou is located...

00:14:44.017 --> 00:14:45.852
...in the building next door.

00:14:45.852 --> 00:14:47.080
Roger.

00:14:52.392 --> 00:14:56.162
So he's chosen the route
of saving the little missy.

00:14:56.162 --> 00:14:57.597
Well, of course, he would.

00:14:57.597 --> 00:15:02.602
If he hadn't, it'd be a waste
of all the bombs I prepared.

00:15:02.602 --> 00:15:07.540
Hey, there. I'm amazed you knew
where to find me, Larry Anderson.

00:15:07.540 --> 00:15:09.509
I'm an underground resident.

00:15:09.509 --> 00:15:13.104
I know how the mind
of a sewer rat like you works.

00:15:19.719 --> 00:15:21.821
Hey, that's enough already!

00:15:21.821 --> 00:15:25.358
Go back the way you came
and go take out that Hou guy first!

00:15:25.358 --> 00:15:27.227
That way...

00:15:27.227 --> 00:15:28.895
Hey, are you listening to me?!

00:15:28.895 --> 00:15:32.332
It's my fault I got caught
by him in the first place,

00:15:32.332 --> 00:15:35.101
so there's no reason for you to save me!

00:15:35.101 --> 00:15:38.969
I don't need a total stranger
like you to do all this for me!

00:15:44.544 --> 00:15:47.480
We are not total strangers.

00:15:47.480 --> 00:15:48.845
What?

00:15:52.919 --> 00:15:54.053
Don't move now.

00:15:54.053 --> 00:15:55.655
Wait, what are you...

00:15:55.655 --> 00:15:57.657
I'm going to dismantle the bomb.

00:15:57.657 --> 00:15:58.885
Don't move.

00:16:09.636 --> 00:16:11.204
Damn!

00:16:11.204 --> 00:16:13.239
Stop the bomb immediately.

00:16:13.239 --> 00:16:16.142
Stop the bomb? Me? Why should I?

00:16:16.142 --> 00:16:17.977
If you don't want to die...

00:16:17.977 --> 00:16:20.680
Well, I don't want to die...

00:16:20.680 --> 00:16:26.085
But unfortunately, once that bomb
is set, even I can't stop it.

00:16:26.085 --> 00:16:27.518
I see.

00:16:31.257 --> 00:16:32.425
Who the?!

00:16:32.425 --> 00:16:35.758
We will be taking Hou into custody!

00:16:43.503 --> 00:16:45.405
What have you done?!

00:16:45.405 --> 00:16:47.273
I have no obligation to obey you.

00:16:47.273 --> 00:16:51.444
You are under arrest for murder,
thief Larry Anderson.

00:16:51.444 --> 00:16:52.745
Can you do it?

00:16:52.745 --> 00:16:55.305
One overclock remaining.

00:16:56.683 --> 00:16:58.751
C-Come on...

00:16:58.751 --> 00:17:01.921
That's enough already,
so get away from here.

00:17:01.921 --> 00:17:04.657
You're looking for your daughter,
aren't you?

00:17:04.657 --> 00:17:08.194
That's why this thing happened, too, right?

00:17:08.194 --> 00:17:11.197
Then follow through with your belief!

00:17:11.197 --> 00:17:13.233
Look for your daughter!

00:17:13.233 --> 00:17:14.500
Forget about me and...

00:17:14.500 --> 00:17:15.899
Shut up!

00:17:16.970 --> 00:17:18.071
Sorry.

00:17:18.071 --> 00:17:20.198
Please be quiet for a bit.

00:17:25.311 --> 00:17:28.414
So you even got your skull resemblized...

00:17:28.414 --> 00:17:31.815
I will live! You guys can die!

00:17:43.663 --> 00:17:45.431
This is the way thieves do things.

00:17:45.431 --> 00:17:46.659
We return every favor.

00:17:49.102 --> 00:17:53.903
No one can stop my artistic bombs!

00:17:58.578 --> 00:18:00.671
The operational limit...

00:18:09.856 --> 00:18:12.659
H-Hey, what's wrong?

00:18:12.659 --> 00:18:16.362
No matter which wire I cut,
it's likely to be a dummy.

00:18:16.362 --> 00:18:17.864
No one can dismantle it.

00:18:17.864 --> 00:18:20.900
Wh-What are you doing giving up?!

00:18:20.900 --> 00:18:23.036
I'm sorry.

00:18:23.036 --> 00:18:26.437
But this time, I'll stay with you.

00:18:45.124 --> 00:18:50.430
Are you all right, Mr. Roy? Miss Rose?

00:18:50.430 --> 00:18:54.634
Solty? You saved us?

00:18:54.634 --> 00:18:56.568
I barely made it in time, though.

00:18:57.603 --> 00:18:59.332
Brother...

00:19:02.976 --> 00:19:04.677
Hou is dead.

00:19:04.677 --> 00:19:06.304
I see.

00:19:07.914 --> 00:19:10.283
- Rose.
- What?

00:19:10.283 --> 00:19:14.014
There's something you should know.

00:19:16.189 --> 00:19:17.588
Integra!

00:19:18.691 --> 00:19:21.494
The operation is a failure.

00:19:21.494 --> 00:19:22.984
What a disgrace...

00:19:23.930 --> 00:19:25.465
Let's withdraw.

00:19:25.465 --> 00:19:26.955
All right.

00:19:28.501 --> 00:19:33.306
The old man is my real father?

00:19:33.306 --> 00:19:37.343
That is right! Is it not amazing?!
What a surprise!

00:19:37.343 --> 00:19:39.278
Who would have thought
you were Mr. Roy's...

00:19:39.278 --> 00:19:41.178
You have got to be kidding me!

00:19:42.682 --> 00:19:47.587
The old man's my father?! I'm not
related by blood to my brothers?!

00:19:47.587 --> 00:19:48.654
There's no way

00:19:48.654 --> 00:19:51.316
you can suddenly drop all that on me
and expect me to believe it!

00:19:52.325 --> 00:19:56.029
But we have proof in the form
of the clothes and shoe you had on.

00:19:56.029 --> 00:19:59.899
So what about my old clothes?!
What about my shoe?!

00:19:59.899 --> 00:20:01.334
The color of my hair changed?!

00:20:01.334 --> 00:20:03.736
So what about the song?!
I don't know anything about that!

00:20:03.736 --> 00:20:06.639
None of that matters.

00:20:06.639 --> 00:20:10.541
If it's true, what about
who I've been all this time?

00:20:12.078 --> 00:20:17.450
I had Father and I had Mother,
and I had my brothers...

00:20:17.450 --> 00:20:22.255
What about me as Rose Anderson
all this time?!

00:20:22.255 --> 00:20:26.726
Are you saying my life
up to now was all a lie?!

00:20:26.726 --> 00:20:29.429
It was not a lie, Rose. That was...

00:20:29.429 --> 00:20:32.265
Shut up! Shut up! I don't
want to hear any of this!

00:20:32.265 --> 00:20:34.460
You say something, too!

00:20:41.240 --> 00:20:43.543
The reason he destroyed my right arm

00:20:43.543 --> 00:20:47.080
was his need to vent his rage at
not being able to find his daughter.

00:20:47.080 --> 00:20:49.549
We are not total strangers.

00:20:49.549 --> 00:20:52.882
But this time, I'll stay with you.

00:20:56.189 --> 00:21:02.261
B-But Miss Rose, Mr. Roy came
all this way to try to save you.

00:21:02.261 --> 00:21:03.396
That alone is...

00:21:03.396 --> 00:21:04.497
It's okay.

00:21:04.497 --> 00:21:05.862
Mr. Roy...

00:21:07.200 --> 00:21:09.498
Being told all that...

00:21:12.572 --> 00:21:16.303
Suddenly being told all that...

00:21:17.210 --> 00:21:20.941
I don't know what
I'm supposed to do with it!

00:21:31.591 --> 00:21:33.354
Miss Rose...

00:23:16.626 --> 00:23:18.128
What in the world am I supposed to do?!

00:23:18.128 --> 00:23:19.162
Pervert!

00:23:19.162 --> 00:23:21.998
I would like for them
to get along better, but...

00:23:21.998 --> 00:23:24.134
Next time, "distance".

00:23:24.134 --> 00:23:27.001
Do you know the distance
at which you pass each other by?
